OL,4,G0306FOutlook
OL,5,     GRanie Saidi was raised by his
OL,6,     Gbeloved grandmother, a celebrated
OL,7,     Gcook in her Malaysian village.
OL,8,     GWhen she died, he moved across
OL,9,     Gthe world - and started cooking
OL,10,     Gher dishes one by one.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GIn the summer of 1937 some of the
OL,13,     G20th Century's most famous
OL,14,     Gartists, writers and
OL,15,     Gphotographers were holidaying in
OL,16,     Gthe south of France. They
OL,17,     Gincluded Pablo Picasso and Lee
OL,18,     GMiller.
